  "description": "The best family in the world who dreams of a great future!\n\nAs the seed of a conspiracy spreads through the family, a dark fate and a bloody storm of martial arts begin to blow. What will you bet your fate on?\n\nThat I am the direct successor to the best family in the world? I don't care at all. I have lived well so far without that kind of halo, and I will continue to do so. Because I choose my own life.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
